175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (For our final project, we decided to create BearLodge, a modern housing app for Berkeley students to find their new homes. While creating BearLodge, we gathered feedback from current students on their experience with searching for housing in Berkeley. A common thread from all of our interviews was that most students need to use a plethora of different methods to find a housing option that suits them. Using this feedback, we designed a sleek and modern user experience that makes searching for housing safe and simple for young Bears.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
