<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (BearLodge deconstructs the oft-complex process of finding housing in Berkeley; namely the steps in the process such as online listing browsing, Facebook group joining, or networking with peers that can be overwhelming for busy and/or inexperienced students. BearLodge then reconstructs this process into one simple and safe user experience, offering account verification that ensures all buyers are confirmed Berkeley students.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
