244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (BearLodge is a mobile application to find and advertise housing! It can be difficult to navigate Berkeley housing, especially as someone who is renting their first apartment or is new to the area. This process often involves juggling Facebook groups, Slack messages, and informal conversations with those who are looking to sublet. The status quo is fragmented and deconstructed, and BearLodge seeks to fix that. As a platform for Berkeley students to connect with one another, we consolidate everything into one place, reconstructing the apartment-hunting process. It is a convenient single location for buyers and sellers alike. BearLodge: Find Your Next Home!)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
