303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Insights: Overall, the users we tested with enjoyed the interactions of our website. The general design was well received, with a few minor suggestions offered regarding coloring or additional instructional labelling on how to get started. The users generally intuitively navigated through creating an account and getting started with the website. The most common confusing area for the users was the seller view: not having a more intuitive way to recognize that the listings were clickable, that the view was not as fleshed out as the buyer view, etc. Also, many of the users suggested that another key functionality to be added would be additional filtering options for the explore page. Being able to filter better by location, price, listing characteristics \(number of rooms, etc.\) would be extremely helpful to a selective college student.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
