/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Messaging In Milestone 2 of the design process, we identified the technical requirements that would be necessary to implement our high-fidelity prototype. In this process, we also assessed the work required to implement each feature and decide whether or not to keep the feature within scope of our Django implementation. After assessing in-app messaging, we determined that it would be a significant amount of work and we would keep it as a stretch goal for the team. As anticipated, in-app messaging was a significant challenge to implement, especially keeping the messaging real-time and designing the unique chat screen. Therefore, we decided to keep in-app messaging out of the final application. )
/E (Messaging In Milestone 2 of the design process, we identified the technical requirements that would be necessary to implement our high-fidelity prototype. In this process, we also assessed the work required to implement each feature and decide whether or not to keep the feature within scope of our Django implementation. After assessing in-app messaging, we determined that it would be a significant amount of work and we would keep it as a stretch goal for the team. As anticipated, in-app messaging was a significant challenge to implement, especially keeping the messaging real-time and designing the unique chat screen. Therefore, we decided to keep in-app messaging out of the final application. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
