/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The complexity of the process to find housing can be a serious challenge for Berkeley students, especially those who may have never lived alone before. With BearLodge, we hope to bring the collective Berkeley housing community into the modern age, and offer a smooth user experience for our fellow students. In the future, we hope to expand to other college campuses so that our work can benefit other student communities.)
